OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 26 Aug to Fri 4 SepFA
OL,6,Frelatively unsettled and changeable
OL,7,Fstart of this period, as showers or
OL,8,Flonger spells of rain are possible
OL,9,Facross many parts of the UK. Some
OL,10,Fheavy bursts and thunderstorms are
OL,11,Flikely at times. Thereafter, it will
OL,12,Flikely remain changeable through the
OL,13,Frest of August and into early
OL,14,FSeptember, with rainfall amounts
OL,15,Fprobably above average for the time
OL,16,Fyear and the potential for some
OL,17,Fstronger winds at times. However, some
OL,18,Fdrier, more settled interludes could
OL,19,Fdevelop at times. Temperatures are
OL,20,Flikely to be near average, although
OL,21,Fsome short-lived warm or hot spells
OL,22,Fare possible, especially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
